  "text": "### Scenario 3: Rate Question  \n**Customer:** \"Your 4.50% rate — is that guaranteed?\"  \n**Your Response:**\n\"It's guaranteed not to drop below Bank of England + 2.5%. Right now BoE is 4.0%, so you get 6.5% AER. If BoE rises, so does your rate. If BoE falls, so does yours — but our 2.5% margin never changes.  \nThis actually works in your favor if rates rise.\"  \n---",
